{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_25c10b740f7138f0607433ae782c7879e69fb45e395fa2cecc99a2d2eec56cd4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ddf3a6f61bcdfadb59489d7420b114a474ca3aeed49557f3b9223bbe8f91d93","slc_9a795d59d3793ee8f47ef253d1a0852b4cfe0982f445dc6a1a20a6dd0b337870","slc_d798dec3e57b1a84bf379842b1eb07d44f5c7bea483c67a71252d4497fb87e96"],"source_ids":["src_c01c22871b1156a3b740a4f963ee2552"],"text":"The system is a single Go control-plane binary that shells out to the Docker CLI (no SDK), fronted by Traefik for preview routing, with SQLite (WAL) as the source of truth and an in-sandbox supervisor called runtimed baked into the base image.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_27c2cdae83c088c029611f5af0bc7b75dd52ee21d0bfd1d820ef60ac1e2159b7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_944c5d1a48d7c999e2fd0df7f5f4f4958687884d1e9fd422777101fa517dff1f","slc_cbd91ba60a590bf33f54c3deb782c58013b89338a4461f69936005f3851ce431"],"source_ids":["src_c01c22871b1156a3b740a4f963ee2552"],"text":"Documented trade-offs include no per-workspace disk quota, default-allow unlogged egress, one instance-wide base image with no per-app image selection, experimental snapshots on directory storage, and no in-sandbox service layer for Postgres/MySQL/Redis.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_39193b384bd8514484a026e19972e97238779c8b5b22456acf87ff3b40d3c7c5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bcaa90d1a4ea4625cbea6e0c5a15285d95cf9b09afd2a7316b588904b160c933"],"source_ids":["src_c01c22871b1156a3b740a4f963ee2552"],"text":"Each sandbox exposes exactly one public preview endpoint (the manifest's web.port); HTTP, WebSocket upgrades, and SSE all work on that single port, while multi-port apps are not reachable on a second port (multi-port is roadmap, not current behaviour).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_39b6b7a89fcb55dc055d665d7f35047a2b89091a28d718484b734e9f615865f9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ddf3a6f61bcdfadb59489d7420b114a474ca3aeed49557f3b9223bbe8f91d93","slc_8dfda5094e337126cd5a1c8d77011849f3c9f6beee0ad48a98f316eaeb8f9490","slc_e6400749a91ba1a968ffda78da997bd8a74df96cc78e905d1401cbb6b9d5fa63"],"source_ids":["src_c01c22871b1156a3b740a4f963ee2552"],"text":"Workspaces live under SANDBOXD_DATA_DIR/workspaces/<id> as bind mounts and survive stop and reboot; control-plane state is a SQLite file; the container writable layer is none (read-only rootfs) and /tmp is tmpfs, so only /home/sandbox is writable in-sandbox.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_468c5c1ae1ae6b478fc7ff3d1c29c1f008e0c5d7059cd5c600a6781644b11068","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_308153086e5efa7eb323d68d09951b80c176dc81640c6b6c96b73de8afa39cce","slc_9440681256107780a727c90ccbdb3e64ce49fa81f2a4368c1aa4e0d01beaf62f"],"source_ids":["src_283a78178ec25110ae9839024a84a29d"],"text":"Running sandboxd requires Docker plus the Compose plugin and git on Linux (macOS via Docker Desktop is best-effort), runs natively on amd64 and arm64, and installs via a one-line curl script.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_67acda3a4f656d110d3cc1f516153c97d1261e1600b7139d0e7939c04e5e2f32","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b5d2750d1162877aa8328b0c27c47c17981fb6d68120929c268294a783537b21","slc_e6a689bbbb66531d277cf3e321b4e813a888b4d0a7f00151268fadd7912ad363"],"source_ids":["src_283a78178ec25110ae9839024a84a29d"],"text":"sandboxd is an open-source, self-hosted AI app builder: a prompt causes a coding agent to build a real app in an isolated sandbox on the user's server, each app live at a preview URL.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_75b5815b0090f20052326fae8ec7601288a8ef2a5e94d455fa4506bd6e8514b8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_455565c864a7b48753ee5d65de5e5a28ec3232d45aa4018751a106fb2f3e2ac4"],"source_ids":["src_283a78178ec25110ae9839024a84a29d"],"text":"The project is beta 0.x: isolation is containers rather than VMs, it is single-server, API auth is off by default, and breaking changes are expected before 1.0.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8cbd2e7199062aab13b507b0bf4591f3c4747abd761fb8f1efbf2bba847c7ed5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50f6c446799329b10e5b42121b0f0cea518017e4ce229f94ab77a8c3b59ee002","slc_8111bc65ed4f56804485bfa66ecca51429edcd5c8db5aa3c2f78608a9849e8d1"],"source_ids":["src_c01c22871b1156a3b740a4f963ee2552","src_ecc21651c8ef5e77ad2a66e5a420d273"],"text":"Agent credentials never enter a sandbox: a control-plane-side auth proxy holds the real keys and injects Authorization/X-Api-Key on the wire, giving the sandbox only a base URL and a dummy key; credential-shaped env vars are scrubbed from agent processes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d23df24be027342632044db5df6a1ad4e1f3468865c2175e324ea82e033ae1a6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3184890d4358653ae3abd680f025232fb4a2bdc79618effe57b17823a355784b"],"source_ids":["src_c01c22871b1156a3b740a4f963ee2552"],"text":"Sandboxes run under hardened runc with all capabilities dropped, no-new-privileges, a read-only rootfs with tmpfs /tmp, a hard memory ceiling, pids limit, and fd ulimits; the threat model is authenticated users running their own code, not hostile multi-tenancy.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e00752f04b3c9ba228ac94d7b44c043cd359127834ca14226a42ee9322f09d6e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_22f64ff1032fd050924606b6c7e493962c60339332fd43ea04e6a0099ac5dd4d","slc_9451486a9028b234f335f3e02703d06b30abf97a2422b4f36326a1dac2c498ad","slc_d88349d9b241dd8acb2cbd438fed1fb4ead611963ad81aea9736bca8bb6f8139","slc_e11f5d5ebbfc17d9d8e6ef6acf76923779d39e7aeead707b0d03c641120f7c37"],"source_ids":["src_ecc21651c8ef5e77ad2a66e5a420d273"],"text":"Repository development practice: AGENTS.md is a copy-pasteable runbook for an AI agent or human to install (./install.sh), operate, drive the API, run the console profile, and uninstall (./uninstall.sh with --images/--data flags) sandboxd.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_eb1ea4d0c150f30055784d8e55d2a215367413a8720316182b7714ca95760e5f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"tastyeffectco/sandboxd@146711407bb9 snapshot f76f0ae5fc6ee5ae","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ddf3a6f61bcdfadb59489d7420b114a474ca3aeed49557f3b9223bbe8f91d93","slc_eb2b794df89de5c11d3b98f61a5a9152b1c6c87922350804848230c2e5434666"],"source_ids":["src_c01c22871b1156a3b740a4f963ee2552"],"text":"The control plane runs an idle reaper that stops sandboxes past an idle threshold and a pressure reaper that stops sandboxes when host memory is low; a wake path starts a stopped container on the first preview request and serves a warming page.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7f1c119f1c4814a29d11f758b368c6"}
